  "limitations": [
    "The source CAD covers the housing. See the runtime report for the display and peripheral behavior.",
    "The K016-T2 catalog, official photographs and source STL document two external sockets, rotary and mounting hardware. The card interface is undocumented.",
    "No physical measurements. Receptacle fit, fastener finish, lens seating and visible encoder shape are product-photo estimates.",
    "The source case including flanges spans 30.4 mm while the official body width is 24 mm. The shell retains its native dimensions.",
    "The board shape remains an internal UNKNOWN envelope. Front A retains its estimated control region. The rotary insert is visual only."
  ],
